{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_title", "source_sha256": "fae0a5b559e4b234882a4315d8c6b97dea59996889cbacfac437ce4718c85ac2", "ja": "ううん、なんでもない。", "zh": "不，什么事也没有。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_synopsis", "source_sha256": "74c5e3ef2807a965ee9645844dfb281641c200f6a70e70b899aa7ed33b354e58", "ja": "センターを任された桃子は自信を見せるもの\nの、プレッシャーからレッスンでミスを繰り\n返してしまう。しかし仲間やプロデューサー\nの言葉で、みんなと一緒に楽しむ事が大切と\n気づき、公演を成功させる。", "zh": "被选为Center的桃子虽然展现出自信，\n却由于压力而在练习时不断出错。\n不过，听了伙伴和制作人的话之后，\n她察觉到重要的是和大家一起享受表演，\n于是顺利完成公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_1000_049mom", "source_sha256": "958a12535fbbd5bd5749ffc6280d0016c104224b6b031d34a2af3321ca69af9e", "ja": "みんな、今日はありがと～！\n桃子たちへの応援、ちゃんと届いてたよ～！", "zh": "今天真的很谢谢大家～！\n给桃子我们的声援，都确实收到了喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_1001_null", "source_sha256": "edafcbce993c2062ba9b981b54f22be1911fe9b2fb88e83c12c1022ee66cede5", "ja": "ワァァァァァ……！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "b4abc72405c5db0a54e9762e60469bd4798b1d7568a065cba5e9d8f1c4971dc2", "ja": "今日の公演は、桃子ひとりじゃ、\nこんなに盛り上がるステージにならなかったと思う。", "zh": "今天的公演，只靠桃子一个人的话，\n是不会如此热闹非凡的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "0fa6baa13cda8c4df888bea32f795abe2221afaf88d84aa31c3ddd6fcdd7c999", "ja": "ファンのみんなと……あとは、仲間の\nみんながいてくれたからだよ！　本当にありがとう！", "zh": "是因为有各位粉丝……还有伙伴们在，才能够做到！\n真的非常感谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "075fd490774bbd03563e1303c34cb0efbd7e76bdee1c9d98ddea23ae97ab8443", "ja": "あ、えっと、桃子のステージ、\nこれからもみんな楽しみにしててね！", "zh": "啊，那么，\n请大家今后也继续期待桃子的表演吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_1005_p", "source_sha256": "740a1912b30cbd481dd1a0937840030fc171878e92ab87a38895fa584d293192", "ja": "（桃子の初センター公演は、大成功で幕を閉じた。\n歓声が、まだステージ裏まで響いている……）", "zh": "（桃子的首次Center公演，非常成功地落幕了。\n连后台都听得到绵延不断的欢呼声……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "2fb8152ab763d5a9891c8c9069214e92d550367dbc0bde136f84868889ed707f", "ja": "お兄ちゃん、お疲れさま！\n桃子のステージの感想、聞いてあげてもいいよ？", "zh": "大哥哥，辛苦了！\n对于桃子表演的感想，桃子也是可以听你说喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c98baa8aa1725def8083d7c837a6f593d71b65c656afbb5def977ea7a80a02d6", "ja": "ああ、会場全体が笑顔に包まれたいいステージだった！\n最後の挨拶も、桃子の素直な気持ちが出ててよかった。", "zh": "嗯嗯，是场让全场观众都绽放笑容的出色表演！\n最后打招呼时，桃子也展露了坦率的心情，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "7e68e5b306830d6681ed2f57db6ce9f0466a4e819c61d3a929c992d2eb250a21", "ja": "え！？\nあ、あれは別に、そんなんじゃ……。", "zh": "咦！？\n那、那个才不是，才不是那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "2a5f145c6fdbc2a7b3133ac29f505063b6fcf0e07fca955e7ef5f824a9869d86", "ja": "桃子ちゃん、お疲れさま！\nすっごくカッコよかったよ！", "zh": "桃子，辛苦了！\n非常帅气喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "568cd08dca50b2061f73b42f26ae2665cdde0b474607b32e30940d5a7777d7f4", "ja": "お客さんも盛り上がってたし、\n最高のステージだったね！", "zh": "观众也很热情，\n真是最棒的表演了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "b7f8e4e2545ade2ab63e5e20d21eea51030f23a191c9df6a3d574d574c71fab2", "ja": "こ、これくらい当たり前だよ？\nだって、桃子がセンターだったんだから。", "zh": "这、这点程度是理所当然的吧？\n毕竟，Center可是桃子啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "8736bccb35878eada70f75e09a090bde18cee9a7cfe34b3c1ee924cebd581351", "ja": "でも……みんな、ありがとう！　みんなが手伝って\nくれたから、最高の公演になったと思う……。", "zh": "不过……大家，谢谢你们！\n因为有大家帮忙，才能成为最棒的公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "769dab4db50d40330d42885705176f8c0de8eacd504515371102e9a9a9eb22ba", "ja": "わたしも、桃子ちゃんと一緒にステージに立てて、\nすごく楽しかったよ！", "zh": "跟小桃一起站上舞台，\n我也感到非常开心喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "0ff1561d98d424a31e8c76480af697fee7e9b7664666d6fddba9fc5cdb295a7f", "ja": "いいな～。たまきも、こんなに楽しいライブなら、\nセンターやってみたいぞ～！", "zh": "真好啊～如果是这么开心的演唱会，\n那环也想担任看看Center～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "96a53599a010f467728c938f499590dcf429d786f33990db68ae10964d8ddd58", "ja": "環ちゃんなら、楽しいライブにできると思うよ！\nですよね、{$P$}？", "zh": "如果是小环的话，一定可以办场开心的演唱会的！\n对吧，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_1016_p", "source_sha256": "059db0a89bffd9e600796451ef731633cbc5f3000de1fcc3fd96ad198c3e91ca", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\n環なら、きっと楽しくてカッコいい公演ができるぞ。", "zh": "对啊，没错。\n如果是环的话，一定会是场开心又帅气的公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "c4cb693e34058dc13a197aa34bb51b86f4d9fd193e4f937294c6232934e1049a", "ja": "ホント！？　やった～！\nくふふ、楽しみだぞ～♪", "zh": "真的！？太好了～！\n呵呵，好期待喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "14452537aa893a56440a61934c5f7db359ac8c443cbe1c83ef456fc1ebdaa6a2", "ja": "よかったですね、{$P$}！\n私も、すっごく楽しかったです。", "zh": "太好了呢，{$P$}！\n我也非常开心喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_1019_p", "source_sha256": "400766e3d0f6c9d797b60249afa25f9acc9d78f6ce9855f8d7077394dda18824", "ja": "やよいが桃子やみんなの事を、しっかり支えてくれた\nおかげでもあるよ。ありがとう、やよい。", "zh": "这也是多亏了弥生有好好地支持着桃子和大家喔。\n谢谢你，弥生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_1020_005yay", "source_sha256": "ced560578d13a6c6b672b5ffeb0ecf77cd0b519826b3b6cc96b01433eda0bf52", "ja": "えへへ……そう言ってもらえると、\nなんだかうれしくなってきちゃいますね。", "zh": "嘿嘿……能被你这么说，\n我也不禁开心起来了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_1021_005yay", "source_sha256": "3692ed2c0e9d92f2085a865ff3a073c503d67192e4b33b5cddc0e9247f3a9616", "ja": "じゃあプロデューサー、よくできましたの……\nハイ、ターッチ！", "zh": "那么，制作人，做得很好的……\n好，击──掌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_1022", "source_sha256": "84c29e7000290de00eaf61887e7ab5f7a175ed6d7a15577b604d361cb5338884", "ja": "ハイタッチ！", "zh": "击掌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_2020_005yay", "source_sha256": "ee22c65bf2a3761c9e4666d7ac66e96405afd08be0411d1665f244054962282e", "ja": "いぇい！", "zh": "耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_2000_049mom", "source_sha256": "457b0cc611043bbd6c4cdf9ac233da0ce22a58fce0a38e092a45452cb3aff1a0", "ja": "あ、お兄ちゃん、やよいさん。\nふたりだけで何してるの？", "zh": "啊，大哥哥，弥生姊，\n你们两个人在做什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_2001_p", "source_sha256": "8b770ad065052712c0f8576e95f7430db8dfba747169821a426876d6a3e88970", "ja": "いや、なんでもないよ。\nそれよりみんな、おなか空いてないか？", "zh": "不，没什么。\n话说回来，大家肚子饿不饿？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_2002_p", "source_sha256": "41d5d1687576a239474f860c44a35698e0f95ae8298de8723bcc90c9bb2ad9aa", "ja": "ファミレスでよければ、何か食べて帰ろう。\n帰りは車で送っていくよ。", "zh": "如果家庭餐厅也好的话，就吃点什么再回去吧。\n回程我会开车送你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_2003_030iku", "source_sha256": "f3cd5d7456206be11f024d0bd731eda14e5bd27c4b6c2c2576b22bc881d8d110", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nわたし、おっきなホットケーキが食べたい！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n我想吃很大的松饼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_2004_040tam", "source_sha256": "6ce79fe53d7ed836c2b9e6917c523427831bd4348a82aa86cdeaae3ba9e90698", "ja": "ホットケーキ！？\nたまきも！　たまきも食べるー！", "zh": "松饼！？\n环也要！环也要吃──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_2005_022ser", "source_sha256": "8c26fac9b3315b5ead8663e20b65249b7b1c4106c417a821b897c7cd3de7972b", "ja": "{$P$}さん、私も食べたいです！\nみんなで行きませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我也想吃！\n大家一起去吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_2006_p", "source_sha256": "055e6b102aafc0025a916015a29a228a554578e98009ea3b5bc21e7358bdbb02", "ja": "よし、じゃあ打ち上げは、\nファミレスのスイーツで決まりだな！", "zh": "好，\n那么庆功宴就决定吃家庭餐厅的甜点了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_2007_022ser", "source_sha256": "7a674f67760975211e9878c106a8c7fa8d94b54fb87e621bc1cc766ea88ffce0", "ja": "わあ♪\n{$P$}さん、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "哇啊♪\n{$P$}先生，谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_2008_030iku", "source_sha256": "d54e75e9478c9b65fade2f653e19bd44c57d9788cb5e3e696a4676be84ddf82d", "ja": "楽しみだね、桃子ちゃん♪", "zh": "真期待呢，桃子♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_2009_049mom", "source_sha256": "7b865f98fd6f7ae1d00f4f90c369be8c2049bc66ba4d567ebe6de6b13850f7ce", "ja": "うん。じゃあ、みんな着替えて準備したら、\nエントランスに集合だからね。", "zh": "嗯，那大家换完衣服、准备好之后，\n就在大厅集合吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_2010_049mom", "source_sha256": "f0b605110bf30edadb6a791c867ec0defa678cd1f3bce8580c6cf325cfcf37f6", "ja": "お兄ちゃんも、遅れないように。\nみんなで一緒に行かなきゃダメだよ！", "zh": "大哥哥也是，不要晚到喔。\n大家要一起去才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_2011_040tam", "source_sha256": "5fa89e0c5ff0325aef8f3bccf144f557ef4e57a3478e90c13160b5bd85362729", "ja": "くふふ、急げ急げ―♪", "zh": "呵呵，快点快点──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_032_2012_p", "source_sha256": "81e370b4aa272e3c3b014b886d311da59eb15383bd80e8255f8813326428b2de", "ja": "（客席に笑顔を届けた桃子。でも今回、一番\nまぶしい笑顔を手に入れたのは、もしかして……）", "zh": "（桃子将笑容传递到了观众席。\n但是这次，获得最耀眼笑容的人，莫非是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
